OL,3,ARussian strikes leave 600,000 without
OL,4,Apower in Ukraine, as Starlink
OL,5,Arestrictions affect front line
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 600,000 people in Ukraine are
OL,8,Fwithout electricity after deadly
OL,9,Fovernight Russian missile and drone
OL,10,Fstrikes, President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FHe said "critical" energy
OL,14,Finfrastructure had been hit in Kyiv and
OL,15,Fthe capital region and in the
OL,16,Fnorth-eastern city of Kharkiv - despite
OL,17,FUS President Donald Trump's claim on
OL,18,FSunday that an "energy ceasefire" was
OL,19,Fin place between Russia and Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
