OL,3,ARussian strikes leave 600,000 without
OL,4,Apower in Ukraine, as Starlink
OL,5,Arestrictions affect front line
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree people were killed in Kyiv,
OL,8,Fofficials said. Russia said its
OL,9,F"massive" strikes had hit
OL,10,Fcommunications and energy facilities
OL,11,Fused by Ukraine's military.
OL,13,FSeparately, Zelensky's adviser said
OL,14,Fspeed restrictions on the Starlink
OL,15,Fcommunications network had disrupted
OL,16,FUkrainian battlefield "missions".
